  "core_overview": {
    "formation": {
      "explanation": "The leader indexes proposals and aggregates per-voter/witness match acknowledgments into current-term commitment; followers validate the preceding term and protect the committed prefix. Commit propagates via replication and bounded heartbeats. Engine exports/persists state and queues committed entries to RSM, whose callbacks complete proposals and expose applied position. For reads, current-term commitment precedes distinct-voter heartbeat confirmation and prefix release; publication then feeds exact-context local batches, which additionally wait for application.",
